n and temperament deficits of the other candidates. The operational importance of B\u2019s numeric\u2011memory weakness and the frequency/severity of his remarks remain uncertain.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** How much B\u2019s weak numeric memory actually affects flight\u2011deck performance, and whether his negative remarks materially degrade crew morale or safety.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that B\u2019s numeric\u2011memory weakness leads to errors or that his remarks cause significant crew\u2011cohesion problems; or credible, documented strengths in stress handling, teamwork, or communication for A, C, or D that outweigh their current drawbacks.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
